      "locked": false,
      "text": "for i in range(len(array)):\n    min = i\n    for j in range(i + 1, len(array)):\n        if tab[j] < tab[min]:\n            min = j\n    if min != i:\n       exchange",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "for i in range(len(array)):\n    min = i\n    for j in range(i + 1, len(array)):\n        if tab[j] < tab[min]:\n            min = j\n    if min != i:\n       exchange",
